  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n17.821 + 178.21 - ? = 169.93\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n17.821 + 178.21 - ? = 169.93\n\n⇒ 18 + 178 - ? = 170\n\n⇒ 18 + 178 - 170 = ?\n\n⇒ 196 - 170 = ?\n\n⇒ 26 = ?\n\n**∴ Required approximate value is 26.**",
